{"blocks":[{"blockId":"block_030533_7fd8e578e7","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":30533,"parentEntityId":null,"recordRole":"SECTION_TITLE","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"25. Veredicto técnico","textHash":"7fd8e578e7e480c6b6c268fcc7ae068d52f64f33384adb3a303204bed6448afc"},{"blockId":"block_030534_2cebdf7514","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":30534,"parentEntityId":null,"recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"La forma correcta de implementarlo en tu APK no es una lista textual gigante. Eso sirve para arrancar, pero el producto serio necesita:","textHash":"2cebdf7514b1f36668d8c8da8c6c1441b5d333463211fff50caee4fc045967c1"},{"blockId":"block_030535_0b254a4570","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":30535,"parentEntityId":null,"recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"Catálogo jerárquico por sistema.","textHash":"0b254a45703f4f59d5b697243f4ed5a573bc70b295a104cb673880585c79b287"},{"blockId":"block_030536_f226f40e25","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":30536,"parentEntityId":null,"recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"Compatibilidad por vehículo: año, marca, modelo, motor, transmisión, mercado.","textHash":"f226f40e2521b6dfe1a57d71a5e4bc137754587ec47e1dbcce42b90bd109682a"},{"blockId":"block_030537_e375d39889","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":30537,"parentEntityId":null,"recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"Relaciones pieza → síntomas → DTC → pruebas → procedimiento → herramientas → torque.","textHash":"e375d398896b9570b1e6d1a52939ce478d6a80a60b895ec329945676e9dfbff4"},{"blockId":"block_030538_a5de9fb1bf","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":30538,"parentEntityId":null,"recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"Variantes OEM y aftermarket.","textHash":"a5de9fb1bf191b3c7d683e855df18d7b5103e0912fe406820960406b23b2c365"},{"blockId":"block_030539_a9d538f31b","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":30539,"parentEntityId":null,"recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"Modo diagnóstico por dependencia.\nEjemplo: no diagnosticar “sensor malo” sin validar alimentación, tierra, señal, continuidad, conector, fusible y ECU.","textHash":"a9d538f31ba09d9221cb95dcdb58ce951ad87c2efa618e19fd786b18138a4d3d"},{"blockId":"block_030540_72ef39f147","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":30540,"parentEntityId":null,"recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"Procedimientos seguros.\nAirbags, HV híbrido/EV, combustible, frenos y refrigerante requieren advertencias específicas.","textHash":"72ef39f147ffa68dffaa84304f106a88f883e44f3ed9e4e8e7e2375a6f116e2a"},{"blockId":"block_030541_3b8e25b128","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":30541,"parentEntityId":null,"recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"Datos medibles.\nTorque, resistencia, voltaje, presión, temperatura, holgura, patrón de onda, tiempo de mano de obra.","textHash":"3b8e25b1284fc813e81c9a469bbfd92c2a4e935ef9cdf0e04cb843acf4514461"},{"blockId":"block_030542_356e5c9d8f","entityId":null,"kind":"paragraph","order":30542,"parentEntityId":null,"recordRole":"SOURCE_DETAIL","sectionPath":[],"styleId":"","text":"La prueba clave para validar esta base: selecciona un vehículo real, por ejemplo Hyundai Accent Verna 2005 1.6 automático, y verifica que el catálogo pueda navegar desde Suspensión delantera → brazo inferior/tijereta → rótula → bujes → barra estabilizadora → bieleta → procedimiento de reemplazo → torque → alineación obligatoria → síntomas → pruebas de holgura. Si esa ruta existe completa, la arquitectura va bien.","textHash":"356e5c9d8fe781edaab634cb2f400377c1c32ab3af5e094fade8168c759c8f41"}],"contentSha256":"04fc4aca41eb8eb263654f1dd0881c14034c0f88a08d4dc921d43c5066a16ccc","corpusId":"meet_owner_proprietary_parts_corpus","schemaVersion":1,"sectionId":"document_17-overview-o030533-25-veredicto-tecnico","sourceDocumentId":"document_17","sourceDocumentSha256":"baf4add3f22202fc7d66f7b7f4aee549d90780f1891da6fa66ffbc2db1820824","sourceFileName":"Document (17).docx","systemId":"overview","titleOriginal":"25. Veredicto técnico","vehicleLabel":"Hyundai Accent/Verna 2005 · caja automática · motor 1600 cc"}
